  "character": "Authentic Haute Maurienne villages (Lanslebourg, Lanslevillard, Termignon) sharing 125km of sunny, uncrowded pistes. Europe's longest green run (L'Escargot, 10km). Best value in the Maurienne. Electric snow groomer \u2014 first in France.",
